                                This can be used in bars and scripts like so:

                                memory=\"\$(neofetch memory)\"; memory=\"\${memory##*: }\"

                                For multiple outputs at once (each line of info in an array):

                                IFS=\$'\\n' read -d \"\" -ra info < <(neofetch memory uptime wm)

