    --ascii source              Shortcut to use the ascii logo with a custom source.

                                NEW: neofetch --ascii \"\$(fortune | cowsay -W 30)\"

    --off                       Shortcut to use 'off' backend (Disable ascii art).

ASCII:
    --ascii_colors x x x x x x  Colors to print the ascii art
    --ascii_distro name         Which bundled ascii art to print: 'macos' or 'mac_small'.
    --ascii_bold on/off         Whether or not to bold the ascii logo.
    -L, --logo                  Hide the info text and only show the ascii logo.

    --gap num                   Gap between logo and text.

